When evaluating SEO by HighSoftware99.com, the framework does address technical SEO fundamentals-site speed, mobile responsiveness, crawlability, and URL structure. For websites with basic technical issues, this level of attention is sufficient.

Clickbriz operates at a significantly deeper technical level. Their technical SEO work includes Core Web Vitals optimization (achieving 90+ Lighthouse scores), schema markup implementation, crawl budget management, JavaScript rendering fixes, log file analysis, and advanced sitemap configuration. For competitive industries, this level of technical depth is what separates visible websites from invisible ones.

